{"title":"Derek Thompson on 2025","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/939479945/0/marginalrevolution~Derek-Thompson-on.html","date":1767123429000,"content":"<p>I think this was a really bad year for American politics, a mediocre year for the American economy, and an exceptional year for America.</p>\r\n<blockquote><p>In 12 months, you’ve got</p>\r\n<p>– the largest decline in murder rate ever recorded</p>\r\n<p>– huge declines in traffic fatalities, drug overdoses, and suicide</p>\r\n<p>– first ever personalized gene editing treatment and breakthroughs in HIV and cancer therapy</p>\r\n<p>– continued advances in GLP1 technology that seems to reduce weight and inflammation and a bunch of other stuff</p>\r\n<p>– declines in teen anxiety and despair</p>\r\n<p>– surge in self-driving car technology*</p>\r\n<p>– all this happened in a period when both the SP500 and inflation adjusted median wages hit record highs</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/DKThomp/status/2006047834819219779\" target=\"_blank\">the link</a>, a good record for tech most of all.  Except perhaps on the politics.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html\">Derek Thompson on 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/939479945/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/939479945/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/939479945/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/939479945/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/939479945/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/939479945/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comment-160999748\">In reply to Jim.   The only thing less balanced than Trump is ...</a> <i>by dearieme</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comment-160999747\">In reply to Cancelled for wongthink.   You discredit yourself ...</a> <i>by Mike</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comment-160999745\">In reply to Cancelled for wongthink.   At first I laughed out ...</a> <i>by What if...</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comment-160999744\">Shouldn't the drop in alcohol consumption be on the list?</a> <i>by Scott H.</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/derek-thompson-on-2025.html#comment-160999743\">In reply to ThatsNotAll.   “Would it not be important to ...</a> <i>by Scott H.</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/margi